***  

A toolkit for interacting with MongoDB Diagnostics data in Gravwell. This kit includes queries, resources (lookups), templates, autoextractors, macros, dashboards, alerts, scheduled searches, and flows to help streamline MongoDB Diagnostics analysis across Diag log sources.  

