## 7. [Playbooks](#7-playbooks)  

- Purpose: Playbooks are hypertext documents within Gravwell which help guide users through common tasks, describe functionality, and record information about data in the system.  
- [Documentation](<https://docs.gravwell.io/gui/playbooks/playbooks.html>)  
- Total: ***2***  
    - MongoDB Diagnostics Kit - Overview: Overview of the items included in the MongoDB Diagnostics Kit.  
    - MongoDB Diagnostics Kit - Readme: A toolkit for interacting with MongoDB Diagnostics data.  

#### 7.1. [Files](#7-1-files)  

- Purpose: Gravwell users can upload small files for use in playbooks, as cover images for kits, etc. Typically, these files are created or selected at the point of use: via a picker in the playbook editor, in the kit builder, etc.  
- [Documentation](<https://docs.gravwell.io/gui/files/files.html>)  
- Total: ***0***  

