## 8. [Searches](#8-searches)  

- Purpose: These queries within the Query Library drive [dashboards](#10-dashboards) to quickly view MongoDB Diagnostics data in an easily digestible format or [scheduled searches](#6-scheduled-searches) to ultimately feed [alerts](#5-alerts).  
- [Documentation](<https://docs.gravwell.io/gui/querylibrary/querylibrary.html>)  
- Total: ***82***  
    - Dashboard Search Total: ***20***  
    - Alert Query Total: ***62***  

#### 8.1. [Dashboard Searches](#8-1-dashboard-searches)  

- Purpose: These queries within the Query Library drive [dashboards](#10-dashboards) to quickly view MongoDB Diagnostics data in an easily digestible format.  
- Total: ***20***  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Count by Component [chart]: This displays a chart of all Component (component) values by count.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Count by Component [numbercard]: This displays a numbercard of all MongoDB Component (component) values by count.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Count by Context [chart]: This displays a chart of all Context (context) values by count.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Count by Context [numbercard]: This displays a numbercard of all MongoDB Context (context) values by count.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Count by Message [chart]: This displays a chart of all Message (message) values by count.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Count by Message [numbercard]: This displays a numbercard of all MongoDB Message (message) values by count.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Count by Service [chart]: This displays a chart of all Service (service) values by count.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Count by Service [numbercard]: This displays a numbercard of all MongoDB Service (service) values by count.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Count by Severity [chart]: This displays a chart of all Severity (severity) values by count.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Count by Severity [numbercard]: This displays a numbercard of all MongoDB Severity (severity) values by count.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Rare Component [numbercard]: This displays the bottom Component (component) during the specified timeframe.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Rare Context [numbercard]: This displays the bottom Context (context) during the specified timeframe.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Rare Service [numbercard]: This displays the bottom Service (service) during the specified timeframe.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Rare Severity [numbercard]: This displays the bottom Severity (severity) during the specified timeframe.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Top Component [numbercard]: This displays the top Component (component) during the specified timeframe.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Top Context [numbercard]: This displays the top Context (context) during the specified timeframe.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Top Service [numbercard]: This displays the top Service (service) during the specified timeframe.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Top Severity [numbercard]: This displays the top Severity (severity) during the specified timeframe.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Total Events [chart]: This displays a chart of all MongoDB values by count.  
    - Search - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Overview - Total Events [numbercard]: This displays a numbercard of all MongoDB events by count.  
- Naming Schema: *Search - MongoDB Diagnostics - MongoDB Diagnostics - {Logtype} - {Logsubtype} - {Name} [Visualization - if any]*  

