## 9. [Templates](#9-templates)  

- Purpose: Templates are special objects which define a Gravwell query containing variables.  
- [Documentation](<https://docs.gravwell.io/gui/templates/templates.html>)  
- Total: ***5***  
    - Template - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Investigation - Count by Component [numbercard]: This is intended to show a numbercard of MongoDB Diagnostics events by structured log component for the investigation scope.  
    - Template - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Investigation - Count by Message [numbercard]: This is intended to show a numbercard of MongoDB Diagnostics events by diagnostic message for the investigation scope.  
    - Template - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Investigation - Count by Severity [numbercard]: This is intended to show a numbercard of MongoDB Diagnostics events by structured log severity for the investigation scope.  
    - Template - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Investigation - Recent Events [table]: This is intended to show recent MongoDB Diagnostics events for the identity, IP, namespace, or component that you are investigating.  
    - Template - MongoDB - Database - Diagnostics - Investigation - Total Events [numbercard]: This is intended to show a numbercard of total MongoDB Diagnostics events for the identity, IP, namespace, or component that you are investigating.  

***  

## 10. [Dashboards](#10-dashboards)  

- Purpose: Dashboards are Gravwell’s way of showing the results from multiple searches at the same time.  
- [Documentation](<https://docs.gravwell.io/gui/dashboards/dashboards.html>)  
- Total: ***2***  
    - MongoDB Diagnostics General Overview: This Dashboard is a general overview of your MongoDB Diagnostic structured logs.  
    - MongoDB Diagnostics Investigation: Investigate MongoDB Diagnostics activity for an identity, IP, namespace, or component.  

#### 10.1. [Actionables](#10-1-actionables)  

- Purpose: Actionables provide a way to create custom menus that key on any text rendered in a query; users can take different actions on that text by selecting options in the menus.  
- [Documentation](<https://docs.gravwell.io/gui/actionables/actionables.html>)  
- Total: ***4***  
    - MongoDB Diagnostics Identity: MongoDB Diagnostics actions on user, principalName, application, client, or context to launch the MongoDB Diagnostics Investigation dashboard.  
    - MongoDB Diagnostics IP: MongoDB Diagnostics actions on remote address, client address, or host to launch the MongoDB Diagnostics Investigation dashboard.  
    - MongoDB Diagnostics Namespace: MongoDB Diagnostics actions on namespace, database, or collection to launch the MongoDB Diagnostics Investigation dashboard.  
    - MongoDB Diagnostics Component: MongoDB Diagnostics actions on structured log component to launch the MongoDB Diagnostics Investigation dashboard.  

